# Staging directory for DataRandomMerge.C: it symlinks the selected input
# files in here, lists the directory to build MasterData_<batch>.lst, and
# hadds what the list names.
#
# Git cannot record an empty directory, so this placeholder is what makes the
# directory exist after a clone. It must stay a dotfile: the macro clears the
# directory with `rm *` at the start of every batch, which does not match
# dotfiles, and builds its file list with `ls`, which does not show them. A
# visible placeholder would be deleted on the first batch and, before that,
# would enter the list and be handed to hadd as if it were a ROOT file.
*
!.gitignore
